# Build output and test scaffolding for the VS Code extension.
#
# `dist` is the webpack bundle (`npm run compile`), `out` is the tsc output the
# integration test runs from (`npm run test-compile`), and `.vscode-test` is the
# ~300MB VS Code build that `@vscode/test-electron` downloads to launch a real
# editor. None of it belongs in the repository.
node_modules/
dist/
out/
.vscode-test/
*.vsix
